<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area early Tuesday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. There were 25,600 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 22,400 formulated and 700 head previously contracted cattle to be shipped this week. Confirmed - None</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
